  "body": "We have one homeserver for our staff members and will have a second one for our students in the near future. Both servers will be federated to share rooms between staff and students. Calls between staff members should be possible. Calls between students should be ok too, but students trying to call staff members will cause some irritation.\r\n\r\nPlease consider an option to disable voip calls between federated homeservers. Other possible solutions:\r\n-\tBlocklists\r\n-\tOption to disable voip in synapse\r\n\r\nEdit: \r\nOption three: Opt-Out per user is allready implementet in element\r\n\r\n",
